<body>
<div class="page">
<header>
<div class="brand ab-brand-line" aria-label="Bottega MarcoAurelio · Orafo · Campo de’ Fiori, centro del centro di Roma"><div class="ab-brand-mainline"><span class="ab-brand-strong">Bottega</span><span class="ab-brand-regular">MarcoAurelio</span><span class="ab-brand-dot">·</span><span class="ab-brand-strong">Orafo</span></div><div class="ab-brand-location">a <a class="map-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Campo%20de%27%20Fiori%20Roma" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Campo de’ Fiori</a> · centro del centro di Roma</div></div>
<a aria-label="English version" class="lang-switch" href="en.html">ENG</a>
</header>
<a aria-label="Vai alla sezione Arabesco Nero" class="hero hero-link" href="#arabesco-nero" id="home">
<img alt="Arabesco Nero · Collezione Aria · Bottega MarcoAurelio" src="assets/ab_arabesco_01.jpg"/>

</a>
<nav aria-label="Azioni rapide" class="quick-top">
